id: magical-being
name: Magical Being
order: 8
category: body
importance: secondary
# (2) The three Unique Abilities, given free when the Trait is gained (racial.mjs giveGrants), and taken with it.
grantsUnique: magical-materialization, healing-hands, telekinesis
description: >
  Your innate magical ability allows you to pick up on magic far easier than most other people.
text: >
  Magical Being (Body): Your innate magical ability allows you to pick up on magic far easier than most other people.
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the TP Cost of all Magical Unique Abilities for you by 3.
  (2)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Magical Materialization, Healing Hands, and Telekinesis Unique Abilities.

---

[passive]
# (1) Never below half the listed cost (slots.mjs).
unique.magical.tpCost -= 3;
